Hi Yawei,

Nice to hear from you! I hope you're staying well and safe.

It's possible to include many different external files into the GUI, though it depends on the type of input you wish to provide and how you want to go about it. If it helps, feel free to peruse the GUI-test file <https://github.com/philchalmers/mirtCAT/blob/master/tests/GUI-tests/GUI-tests.R>, which I use for testing the package prior to releases, and demonstrates a few ways to input external figures (tables can be input in many different ways, such as via HTML code or by simply screenshotting a table and treating it as an image). HTH, and let me know if you have any further questions!

Phil

